### Create cart – success (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/storefront/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{storeToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}

### Get cart – success (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/storefront/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{storeToken}}

### Add item to cart – no auth (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/storefront/cart/items
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "variantId": "{{nonExistentId}}",
  "quantity": 1
}

